course: dictionary
lesson: 12697
title: Docile: calm and gentle
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Docile means quiet, calm and easy to control or teach. When it describes an animal, it means gentle and not likely to bite or fight. You can use the words around it to work out this meaning.
explain: «The docile cow let the children stroke its nose.» A cow that lets children touch its nose is calm and gentle. So docile must mean calm and easy to handle.
explain: «Our guinea pig is docile and gentle, so it never bites.» The word gentle sits right next to docile and points the same way, so the two words are close in meaning. Try swapping in calm and gentle: the sentence still makes sense.
explain: In stories, docile can describe a person or animal who does what they are told, sometimes too much. «The docile dog obeyed every order, even the silly ones.» Here the dog's obedience is so complete that it is almost a problem.
fact: Docile means quiet, calm and easy to control or teach.
fact: For animals, docile means gentle and not likely to bite or fight.
fact: «A docile animal» is one that is calm and easy to handle.
fact: Guinea pigs and some cows are often described as docile.
fact: In stories, docile can mean someone who does what they are told, sometimes too much.
exercise: «The docile cow let the children stroke its nose.» What does docile mean? | Lost in the field | Fast and noisy | *Calm and easy to handle | Hungry and angry
exercise: «Our guinea pig is docile and gentle, so it never bites.» Which word in the sentence means nearly the same as docile? | *gentle | never | guinea | bites
exercise: In a story, «the docile servant did whatever the master said, even when it was wrong.» What does docile suggest here? | Brave and loud | Lost and frightened | Happy and funny | *Obedient, doing what it is told, sometimes too much
test: «The docile horse stood still while the farmer put on its saddle.» What does docile mean here? | Fast and wild | Angry and noisy | *Calm and gentle | Hungry and tired
test: Which animal is often described as docile? | Lion | Shark | Wolf | *Guinea pig
exam: Priya says, «The docile puppy let me take its toy.» Which clue shows that docile means calm and gentle? | Puppy | Priya | *Let me take its toy | Toy
